{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hegemonism: Cold War</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hegemonism: Cold</i></strong><i> <strong>War</strong></i> is an indie turn-based card strategy game that immerses players in the geopolitical struggle between the US and USSR. Craft your deck from 200+ historically inspired cards and employ every means\u2014event cards, influence placement, international crises, coups, UN maneuvers, and the Space Race\u2014to outmaneuver your opponent in this global contest of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Strategic Depth</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Continental Scenarios</i>: Master regional conflicts across Europe, Latin America, Asia, Africa, and the Middle East</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Endless Global Mode</i>: Unlock worldwide domination, leveraging historical events to crush your rival within limited turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*200+ Cards*: Build a unique deck from events spanning espionage, proxy wars, and diplomatic showdowns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Historical Authenticity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pivotal Crises</i>: Relive the Cuban Missile Crisis, Korean/Vietnam Wars, and other flashpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Era-Defining Movements</i>: Navigate the Non-Aligned Movement, Bandung Conference, Iranian Revolution, and Middle East conflicts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Meticulous Research</i>: Every card reflects archival sources, from KGB files to presidential memos</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846040?t=1753325877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846040/b64df0d5b1fc64b6dee25528cfaf1bbd15d3d8a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753325877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass